: "约4至16秒间可听到多人简短说话，包括“你好”和“好意”等简短语句，末尾有人说“志愿”。"}, {"available_at": 17.6, "clip_id": 1, "epistemic_status": "model-generated semantic claim", "kind": "semantic", "memory_node_id": "19", "raw_contents": ["围桌者与桌上成组收纳包、纸笔和电子设备表明他们正在参加一项有组织的集体活动、讨论或任务准备，而非普通用餐。"], "raw_text": "围桌者与桌上成组收纳包、纸笔和电子设备表明他们正在参加一项有组织的集体活动、讨论或任务准备，而非普通用餐。"}, {"available_at": 17.6, "clip_id": 1, "epistemic_status": "model-generated semantic claim", "kind": "semantic", "memory_node_id": "20", "raw_contents": ["拍摄者反复查看并最终归零启动秒表，说明其可能在为接下来的活动设定时限或记录任务时间。"], "raw_text": "拍摄者反复查看并最终归零启动秒表，说明其可能在为接下来的活动设定时限或记录任务时间。"}, {"available_at": 17.6, "clip_id": 1, "epistemic_status": "model-generated semantic claim", "kind": "semantic", "memory_node_id": "21", "raw_contents": ["参与者在拍摄者操作计时器时持续坐在各自位置，显示他们可能正在等待计时任务开始或听取安排。"], "raw_text": "参与者在拍摄者操作计时器时持续坐在各自位置，显示他们可能正在等待计时任务开始或听取安排。"}, {"available_at": 17.6, "clip_id": 1, "epistemic_status": "model-generated semantic claim", "kind": "semantic", "memory_node_id": "22", "raw_contents": ["现有画面未提供任何带ID的面部特征，因此无法可靠建立面部与语音特征的等价关系。"], "raw_text": "现有画面未提供任何带ID的面部特征，因此无法可靠建立面部与语音特征的等价关系。"}], "observations": [{"assignment_run_id": "jake/C3/online/clip_1", "audio_ref": "/opt/streammeco/run/online_memory_benchmark/20260918_sol_astra/smoke/maintenance_terra01/C3/intermediate/clip_1_voices.tst.json#/rows/0/audio_segment", "clip_id": 1, "created_graph_version": "online_1", "end_time": 6.0, "original_assignment_evidence": {"kind": "online_committed_voice_mapping", "source_graph": "/opt/streammeco/run/online_memory_benchmark/20260918_sol_astra/smoke/maintenance_terra01/C3/checkpoint.pkl"}, "original_transcript": "你好你", "original_voice_id": "voice_0", "session_id": "jake/C3", "start_time": 4.0, "transcripts": {"Deepgram": "你好你"}, "utterance_id": "jake/C3/utt_000001_0000"}, {"assignment_run_id": "jake/C3/online/clip_1", "audio_ref": "/opt/streammeco/run/online_memory_benchmark/20260918_sol_astra/smoke/maintenance_terra01/C3/intermediate/clip_1_voices.tst.json#/rows/1/audio_segment